      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Before the 1830s, Cross Village thrived as a lumber producer and fishing hub thanks to its waterfront location.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.awesomemitten.com/cross-village-michigan/",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Centuries ago, Cross Village served as a Native American gathering and trading center, making it one of Michigan’s oldest settlements.",
